KLEANFW changes
---------------

Changes made by AislanJefferson on top of GOGUFW 3.6.2 include the HOP voice
scrambler and the CryKey passphrase with XTEA-CTR encrypted Messenger text,
the CryKey menu item, Spectrum changes (MR list sweep, bandwidth persistence,
backlight timer), reduced SPI flash wear, the USB reply alignment fix and
other fixes listed in CHANGELOG.md. Modified source files carry a
"Modified by AislanJefferson for KLEANFW" notice; the git history records
every change. Files added by KLEANFW carry their own copyright header.

